This is the folder containing my first full activation patching tests!

## Objective ##
Search for the layers that are most responsible for recovering the signal.

## Data ##
multi_fast5_zip_v0.pod5, 250 timeslices from 54250 to 54500.
Modification for corruption: clean signal[100:106] was stolen and placed into clean signal[130:136] to create a corruption

## Metrics ##
The amount the MSE loss between the clean and patched signal is reduced.
baseline_diff = torch.nn.functional.mse_loss(score_window_corrupted.to(torch.float32), score_window_clean.to(torch.float32)).item()
patched_diff = torch.nn.functional.mse_loss(score_window_corrupted.to(torch.float32), score_window_clean.to(torch.float32)).item()
recovery_score = 1.0 - (patched_diff / baseline_diff)

